    "detailed_description": "On the revolution bridge, K-12 and Z4 raise up against those who rose up before. Those who were his former battle partners.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295220/extras/27418d3e707116cd88cb8de0a1716eed.poster.avif?t=1733336586\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295220/extras/27418d3e707116cd88cb8de0a1716eed.webm?t=1733336586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295220/extras/27418d3e707116cd88cb8de0a1716eed.mp4?t=1733336586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROTOCOL:NULL</h2>It is a third-person shooter set in the cyberpunk world, taking place in the futuristic and uneven EAcity, the game is separated into phases, with its own characteristics but focusing on horde survival and tower defense elements.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295220/extras/d52a9702b562a16d186644685fc5d873.avif?t=1733336586\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2>In <i>EA-city</i> a new gang emerges, the group formed of: replicants, droids and robots called themselves <i>DICE</i>, the group rebelled against the large corporation <i>Actavision Corps</i>. The first confrontation ended with a victory for <i>DICE</i>, in which a large <i>Actavision</i> factory was taken over, and became the gang's base, <i>Actavision</i> joined forces with other companies such as <i>Capskon</i> and <i>Kimami</i>, and subsequently a series of confrontations occurred between them, Several protests emerge, gradually damaging the image of companies.<br>The city has turned into chaos, two <i>DICE </i>soldiers stand out, <strong>K-12</strong> and <strong>Z4</strong> join the elite group <strong>Task Force 414</strong>, carrying out sabotage missions in companies. However, after a mission, <strong>Z4</strong> is captured and his programming is changed, and he now follows <i>Actavision's</i> orders,<br>His new objective is to take a bomb to the <i>DICE</i> base, <strong>K-12</strong>, aiming to save his friend, makes a deal with <i>Actavision</i>, so that the two can be free after completing their mission. This way, the two go to the headquarters of their old gang.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295220/extras/e2d39a8c11e19b540a447b91a9f6db4f.poster.avif?t=1733336586\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295220/extras/e2d39a8c11e19b540a447b91a9f6db4f.webm?t=1733336586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295220/extras/e2d39a8c11e19b540a447b91a9f6db4f.mp4?t=1733336586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Play with two different characters and their respective classes;<br></li><li> Play with eight different weapons;<br></li><li> Test your weapons in firerange;<br></li><li> Weapons and Characters have their own progression and customization, you can unlock Weapons, Attachments, Classes, Skills, Items, Skins and Camos;<br></li><li> Differente playstyles;<br></li><li> Buy Supplies and Interact with the environment to survive;<br></li><li> Upgrade the car;<br></li><li> Push and Defend the car  against hordes of enemies;<br></li><li> Play Chosen Asteroid;</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295220/extras/f221faa966ea1f5c3662297b7a5e7f9c.poster.avif?t=1733336586\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295220/extras/f221faa966ea1f5c3662297b7a5e7f9c.webm?t=1733336586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295220/extras/f221faa966ea1f5c3662297b7a5e7f9c.mp4?t=1733336586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GENERAL INFOS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> The game will be updated periodically after release;<br></li><li> Support for the main controls on the market;<br></li><li> Support for Steam achievement;</li></ul>",
